# WolkaraForever layer patch 0067 - the unsigned package is named after the app
#
# Why: the artifact was `Tolkara-unsigned.ipa`, which names the upstream runtime
# rather than what the user installs, and reads as a second product beside the
# app. Every path that produces, verifies, documents or publishes it now says
# `wolkaraforever-unsigned.ipa`. The bundle inside stays `TolkaraDiagnostics.app`,
# because that is the target and the scheme.
#
# Applies to: AGENTS.md, README.md, docs/BUILDING.md, tools/package_ipa.sh,
# .github/workflows/release.yml.
# Upstream: candidate.

